{"id":"en_resident-evil","title":"Resident Evil","titleEn":"Resident Evil","description":"A storm cuts off Emily and her wealthy boyfriend from the outside world, leaving them stranded in a mountain villa while a genetically altered black bear stalks the guests. The creature is disturbingly clever: it copies the sound of knocking, breaks through security codes, and never forgets a face that has wronged it. Emily eventually learns that Ryan was involved in the brutal experiments behind the bear, turning mere survival into a settling of accounts. Known as Subject Seven, the animal is driven by a single purpose—making every one of its tormentors answer for what they did. Those following this story can watch it unfold on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/resident-evil/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/resident-evil/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mystery","Karma","Horror","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cvs/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_resident-evil_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cvs/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_resident-evil_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cvs/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_resident-evil_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cvs/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_resident-evil_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cvs/?pu